#BlueJ class context
comment0.target=Boid
comment0.text=\n\ A\ boid\ represents\ one\ member\ of\ a\ flock.\ It\ follows\ several\ steering\ behaviors\n\ (cohesion,\ separation,\ alignment,\ wall\ avoidance)\ to\ produce\ emergent\ flocking.\n\ It\ also\ responds\ to\ audio\ cues\ (beat\ flashes\ or\ mic\ input)\ when\ in\ FILE\ or\ MIC\ mode.\n\n\ Steering\ rules\ are\ applied\ via\ a\ functional\ pipeline\ for\ modularity.\n\n\ @author\ Poul\ Henriksen,\ Liz\ Black\n\ @version\ 3.0\n
comment1.params=
comment1.target=Boid()
comment1.text=\n\ Constructor\:\ initializes\ sprite,\ color\ tint,\ and\ random\ velocity.\n
comment10.params=
comment10.target=Vector\ getWallForce()
comment10.text=\n\ Wall\ avoidance\ force\ pushes\ boid\ away\ from\ world\ edges.\n
comment11.params=distance\ cls
comment11.target=java.util.List\ getNeighbours(int,\ java.lang.Class)
comment11.text=\n\ Retrieves\ neighbors\ within\ a\ distance\ (raw\ List\ to\ allow\ adding\ 'this').\n
comment12.params=distance
comment12.target=Vector\ getCentreOfMass(int)
comment12.text=\n\ Computes\ center\ of\ mass\ of\ neighbors\ +\ self\ within\ distance.\n
comment13.params=distance
comment13.target=Vector\ getFlockAttraction(int)
comment13.text=\n\ Attraction\ toward\ center\ of\ mass\ for\ cohesion\ behavior.\n
comment14.params=distance
comment14.target=Vector\ getFlockRepulsion(int)
comment14.text=\n\ Repulsion\ from\ too-close\ neighbors\ and\ obstacles.\n
comment15.params=distance
comment15.target=Vector\ getAverageVelocity(int)
comment15.text=\n\ Computes\ average\ velocity\ of\ neighbors\ +\ self\ for\ alignment.\n
comment16.params=distance
comment16.target=Vector\ getFlockAlignment(int)
comment16.text=\n\ Steering\ vector\ toward\ matching\ neighbor\ headings.\n
comment2.params=src\ tint
comment2.target=greenfoot.GreenfootImage\ tintOpaquePixels(greenfoot.GreenfootImage,\ greenfoot.Color)
comment2.text=\n\ Tint\ opaque\ pixels\ of\ the\ sprite\ with\ a\ pastel\ color.\n
comment3.params=
comment3.target=void\ act()
comment3.text=\n\ Called\ once\ per\ frame\:\ updates\ sprite\ (pulse\ &\ glow),\ then\ moves.\n
comment4.params=
comment4.target=void\ poseStep()
comment4.text=\n\ Handles\ motion\ toward\ a\ static\ target\ (letter\ pose)\ and\ jitter\ on\ arrival.\n
comment5.params=p\ hold
comment5.target=void\ setTarget(Vector,\ int)
comment5.text=\n\ Assigns\ a\ new\ pose\ target\ and\ resets\ arrival\ state.\n
